{"id":"80437993eb","t":"Asha of the Border","c":"cv","n":23,"l":24,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border"},"u":1795038402656,"desc":"«الأميرة التي ستولد ستقتل الملك.» في ظل هذه النبوءة، طُردت الأميرة رينيه من القصر الملكي بعد أن عانت من سوء المعاملة على يد الملكة الأم وشهدت مقتل والدها. وكان إيدن -وهو رجل من قبائل المناطق الحدودية- هو من أنقذ رينيه من حافة الموت مانحًا إياها اسمًا جديدًا وحياةً جديدة…","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["دراما","رومانسى","ماساة"],"src":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/1/"},"2":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/2/"},"3":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/3/"},"4":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/4/"},"5":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/5/"},"6":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/6/"},"8":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/8/"},"9":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/9/"},"10":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/10/"},"11":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/11/"},"12":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/12/"},"13":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/13/"},"14":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/14/"},"15":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/15/"},"16":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/16/"},"17":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/17/"},"18":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/18/"},"19":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/19/"},"20":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/20/"},"21":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/21/"},"22":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/22/"},"23":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/23/"},"24":{"ml":"asha-of-the-border|/manga/asha-of-the-border/24/"}}}